{"id":"wb-5-202","name":"先农坛","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"先农坛","text":"先农坛建筑群是明清两代皇帝祭祀先农诸神和太岁诸神和举行亲耕的地方，位于北京市西城区南中轴线西侧，与天坛东西相对，遥相呼应。是全国重点文物保护单位。2024年7月27日，先农坛作为“北京中轴线——中国理想都城秩序的杰作”的组成部分，入选世界遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%88%E5%86%9C%E5%9D%9B","revisionId":92033875,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92033875","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6e8763770a5528f2baa507dd.jpg","title":"Xiannongtan-guangengtai.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xiannongtan-guangengtai.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/Xiannongtan-guangengtai.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"原上传者为中文維基百科的用心阁","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​北京先农坛 太岁殿院中的观耕台 拍摄","width":320,"height":240}}